read: blind Opus on step A (Gate-Reader: LAND-AFTER-CURES, P2-a live device count and P2-b readers enforce → cured in steps A/B); step B (Fold-Reader: P1 the witness re-judged late and failed open on the cap → the frozen spend; P2 the ward lived only in the door + the unseen-ask bypass → steps C/D); steps C–E (Ward-Key-Reader: P1 the browser ward seed under the ordinary custody rows → step F; P2 set-aside issuer → refused); step F (Seed-Row-Reader: P2 a typo binds the ward key for good → retype; P3 a refused cap tip fell back looser → tightest/braked). Every finding cured red-first; promote-probe's brake regression cured (gates-first retry on a thrown ward need); the browser boot regression (the ward worker dropped its first message under a top-level wasm await) cured — the worker loads nothing until an act arrives and refuses ward-worker-failed. CI 42176515937 green at 4d102bb10; this head merges canon only (PR #170) over it. Defaults pending the operator: the ward key in the admission + pop + warded approvals (admission bytes).

